  "brain_first": "“只从听到的事实多走半步；不能用自己的生活经验补剧情。”",
  "sort_order": 1011,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 492
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What can we infer? / What does the man",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 493
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "imply?",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 494
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 495
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "推断不是原句照抄，但必须有证据。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 496
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “只从听到的事实多走半步；不能用自己的生活经验补剧情。”",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 497
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 正确选项通常是对说话人意图、下一步或隐藏含义的合理改写。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 498
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 499
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先记明确事实。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 找语气和上下句关系。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 501
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 把选项分成“文本能推出”和“现实可能但没证据”。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 502
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 选择需要最少额外假设的答案。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 503
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 504
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 505
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 506
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “I wish I had...” → 暗示现在没有/之前没做",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 507
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “Another ten minutes and I'll miss...” → 暗示时间紧",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 508
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 反问常表达否定或质疑",
      "sourcePage": 18,
      "sourceIndex": 509
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 答案只需要一个小推理就成立。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 510
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若某选项需要你想象人物过去经历、性格或未来长期结果，通常过度推断。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 511
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 512
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I'd love to join you, but my report is due first thing tomorrow.",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 513
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可以推断：他大概率不会参加；不能推断：他讨厌这项活动。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 514
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 515
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把常识当录音证据。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 516
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 推断过远。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 517
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 518
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 证据是哪一句？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 519
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 我有没有偷偷加一个录音没说的前提？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 520
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 521
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 522
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 523
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 推断只走半步。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 524
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 526
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “I’d love to go, but my report is due tomorrow.”可推断？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 527
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 能否推断speaker讨厌活动？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 528
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. “I wish I had booked earlier.”暗示？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 529
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 推断选项需要额外编人物性格，是否稳？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 530
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 推断首要依据？",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 531
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. speaker probably cannot/will not go；2. 不能。；3. 没有早点预订/现在后悔。；4. 不稳，通常过度",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 532
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "推断。；5. 录音明确事实+一小步逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 533
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L8 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L8”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 19,
      "sourceIndex": 534
    }
  ],
